/**
 * @defgroup MCC_Interval Interval
 * @ingroup MCC
 * @brief Directed intervals and spelling-preserving transposition.
 *
 * `MCC::Interval` stores a diatonic step count and a semitone count, from
 * which its `MCC::IntervalDirection`, `MCC::IntervalNumber` and
 * `MCC::IntervalQuality` are derived. `MCC::IntervalBetween()` measures the
 * interval between two pitches or note names, and `pitch + interval`
 * transposes while preserving spelling: `E4 + M3 = G#4`, never `Ab4`.
 * See @ref MCC_Specification (SPEC-INT-*).
 *
 * Available when `MCC_INTERVAL` is defined. Requires the Pitch module.
 */
